  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in the bottom of a clay tagine or Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chicken and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the spices, broth, and herbs, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring to a boil, then cover and transfer to the oven.",
    "Bake at 300°F (150°C) for 30 minutes, or until the chicken is cooked through.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with parsley."
